{{!
    @template core/login_panel

    Branding panel on the left of the EJI ONE login screen.

    This overrides Boost's version, which advertises Moodle's own user, site
    and country counts. Those numbers are about Moodle the product, not about
    this installation, and they do not belong on an EJI login screen.

    If the site has auth instructions configured, they replace the panel
    entirely - the same rule Boost applies.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * ejibrand - Brand name.
    * ejitagline - Line shown under the brand.
    * leftinstructions - Optional site auth instructions, which take priority.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "ejibrand": "EJI",
        "ejitagline": "EJI Learning Portal",
        "leftinstructions": ""
    }
}}
<div class="login-layout-left-content eji-login__panel">
    {{^leftinstructions}}
        <div class="eji-login__brand">
            <span class="eji-login__brandname">{{ejibrand}}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="eji-login__tagline">{{ejitagline}}</p>
    {{/leftinstructions}}
    {{#leftinstructions}}
        <div class="eji-login__instructions">
            {{{leftinstructions}}}
        </div>
    {{/leftinstructions}}
</div>
